Answer: The eight Ivy League universities are: Harvard, Yale, Dartmouth, Brown, University of Pennsylvania (Penn), Cornell, Princeton, and Columbia.

Source URL: https://www.admitedge.com/blog/lvy-league-colleges/

### From which institution did Joseph R. Biden Jr. (Joe Biden) earn his undergraduate bachelor's degree?
